# Algorithm Visualizer

Interactive web application for visualizing classic algorithms
and data structures.

## Project Status

Phase 1 — Foundation

## Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript ES6+
- Vite
- npm
- ESLint
- Prettier

## Planned Features

- Sorting visualizations
- Searching visualizations
- Stack simulator
- Queue simulator
- Algorithm complexity information
- Animation controls
- Responsive interface
- Accessibility support
- Automated testing
- CI/CD
- GitHub Pages deployment

## Local Development

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```
